@startmindmap
* Prometheus: dezentrale KI-Threat-Intelligence auf Kaspa
** modules/client
*** built: main.rs::Cli (miner-companion, rule-sync, threat-hint, threat-hint-v2)
*** built: network/p2p.rs::submit / submit_v2 (dial-only QUIC)
*** built: blockchain/rule_coordinator.rs::RuleCoordinator (dev)
*** partial: security/scanner.rs::YaraScanner (custom matcher, kein YARA)
*** partial: ai/phi3.rs, detection.rs, federated.rs (fail-closed Stubs)
*** open: echte Phi-3/ONNX-Inferenz, Fed-DART, ZK-Prover
** modules/guardian-p2p
*** built: lib.rs::GuardianP2p (ballot + hint v1/v2 Kanaele)
*** built: transport_identity, relay_service, service.rs::run_service
*** blocked: public multi-host operation
** modules/guardian-node (jaeger)
*** built: threat_hint_service.py + threat_hint_ingress.py (reparse, replay, outbox)
*** built: threat_hint_v2 promotion/acceptance/worker/semantic-draft
*** built: ballot_ingress.py, ensemble.py, membership source/transition
*** partial: legacy analyzer/llm/yara (kein Live-Modell-Nachweis)
*** open: actionable Analyse, Produktions-Autoritaet
** modules/threat-hint
*** built: v1/v2 Schemata, Produzenten, Approval, Endpoint-Observation-Parser
** modules/threat-proof
*** built: KIP-16 Groth16 verify / verify-v2 (Test-Artefakte)
*** blocked: Produktions-Relation/Keys/Zeremonie
** modules/validator-node
*** built: voting/commit, voting/reveal, slashing (Zustandsautomaten)
*** open: betriebenes Validator-Netz
** modules/contracts
*** built: silverc/*.sil (7 Fixtures, Gates gruen)
*** built: legacy *.ss (nur Historie)
*** blocked: sechs State-Deployments + Oracle-Ausfuehrung
** modules/silverc-deployer
*** built: keyless Genesis + reportMetrics Operator; H-001 Canary bestaetigt
*** blocked: verbleibende externe Signaturen/Evidence
** modules/web + scripts
*** built: Public-Site-Seiten (Repo-Root), Release-Tooling
*** removed: fabriziertes Audit-Dashboard (GH-273)
** target
*** open: PROM Emission, IPFS Distribution, public Multi-Host
*** open: Mobile (Flutter), Tauri UI
*** open: GH-258/261 Endpoint Detection (observe -> warn -> contain)
@endmindmap

@startuml
title Prometheus Komponenten (nur verifizierte Hops; Baseline 32ca5f1)

package "modules/client" as Client {
  [main.rs::Cli\nThreatHintCommand::Submit] as ClientMain
  [network/p2p.rs\nThreatHintSubmitConfig::submit] as ClientSender
  [rule_sync_cli.rs +\nblockchain/rule_coordinator.rs] as RuleSync
  [security/scanner.rs\nYaraScanner (dev)] as Scanner
}

package "modules/guardian-p2p" as P2P {
  [lib.rs::GuardianP2p\n/prometheus/threat-hint/1.0.0 + 2.0.0\n/prometheus/guardian-ballot/1.0.0] as Transport
  [threat_hint_ingress.rs\nUnixThreatHintIngress::forward] as HintIngress
  [threat_hint_v2_ingress.rs\nUnixThreatHintV2Ingress] as HintV2Ingress
  [ingress.rs::UnixBallotIngress] as BallotIngress
}

package "modules/guardian-node (jaeger)" as Guardian {
  [threat_hint_service.py\nThreatHintIngressServer] as HintService
  [threat_hint_ingress.py\nThreatHintIngress + Replay-Ledger] as HintVerify
  [threat_hint_adapter.py\ndrain_once] as Adapter
  [analyzer.py\nprocess_verified_threat_hint] as Analyzer
  [threat_hint_v2_promotion.py::promote] as Promotion
  [threat_hint_v2_acceptance.py::accept] as Acceptance
  [observable_analysis_worker.py] as Worker
  [observable_semantic_draft.py] as Draft
  [ballot_ingress.py + signed_ballots\n+ ensemble.py::EnsembleVoter] as Voting
}

package "modules/threat-proof" as Proof {
  [main.rs::Command::Verify / VerifyV2\nKIP-16 Groth16 (manifest-pinned)] as Verifier
}

package "modules/contracts/silverc" as Contracts {
  [ValidatorStakingState.sil\nGuardianReputationState.sil\nRuleStorageState.sil\nGovernanceAutoTuningState.sil (+3)] as Fixtures
}

package "modules/silverc-deployer" as Deployer {
  [main.rs::Cli\ngenesis + reportMetrics] as Operator
}

database "SQLite (owner-only)" as DB
actor "externer BIP340-Signer\n(ausserhalb des Repos)" as Signer

ClientMain --> ClientSender : config + canonical hint (<=2048 B)
ClientSender --> Transport : dial-only QUIC, ThreatHintBytes
Transport --> HintIngress : exact canonical bytes
HintIngress --> HintService : AF_UNIX frame (peer-UID)
HintService --> HintVerify : reparse + freshness + replay
HintVerify --> Verifier : groth16_kip16_v1 (exit 0/1/2/3)
HintVerify --> DB : replay ids + 1 outbox job (atomic)
Adapter --> DB : claim <=32 jobs (lease)
Adapter --> Analyzer : VerifiedThreatHint (ohne Indikatoren)
Analyzer --> Adapter : AnalysisResult (0.0, no rule, should_submit=false)
Adapter --> DB : mark-delivered
HintService --> HintIngress : ACK accepted/duplicate/rejected/busy (<=384 B)

ClientSender --> Transport : submit_v2 (/prometheus/threat-hint/2.0.0)
Transport --> HintV2Ingress : canonical PHT2 frame
HintV2Ingress --> Promotion : reparse gegen trusted network
Promotion --> Acceptance : policy vor Verifier-Aufruf
Acceptance --> Verifier : verify-v2 (Subprozess)
Acceptance --> DB : durable approval consumption (letzter Schritt)
Worker --> DB : governed claim/complete
Worker --> Draft : memory-only YARA draft (compile-only)

Transport --> BallotIngress : /prometheus/guardian-ballot/1.0.0
BallotIngress --> Voting : owner-only AF_UNIX

RuleSync --> Scanner : atomicer Scanner-Ersatz (checkpoint)
Operator --> Fixtures : recompile predecessor/successor
Operator --> Signer : nur 32-byte Digest
Operator --> DB : intent journal (one-shot broadcast)
@enduml
